  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the garlic (or use a garlic press). In a medium saucepan, melt the butter and a dash of olive oil over a medium heat. Add 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (for the rice) and the salt and bring to the boil. Add the jasmine rice, stir, then cover with a lid and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 12 minutes, then remove the pan from the heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam  so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5eba502ebcb2e97b7b7589e7/step-e315365b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, thinly slice the carrot (unpeeled) into half-moons. Thinly slice the brown onion. Thinly slice the Asian greens. Trim the snow peas. Finely grate the ginger. Quarter each piece of Chinese tofu.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5eba502ebcb2e97b7b7589e7/step-04fbf2be.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the ginger, soy sauce, sweet chilli sauce, water (for the sauce), remaining garlic and 1/2 the sesame oil blend. Heat a medium frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the mixed sesame seeds and toast, tossing, until golden, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5eba502ebcb2e97b7b7589e7/step-685bb70a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return the frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add the tofu and cook, tossing occasionally, until browned and warmed through, 4 minutes. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5eba502ebcb2e97b7b7589e7/step-55d15e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the garlic rice between bowls and top with the ginger-soy veggies and Chinese tofu. Garnish with the crushed peanuts and toasted sesame seeds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5eba502ebcb2e97b7b7589e7/step-9a41dae7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the garlic rice between bowls and top with the ginger-soy veggies and Chinese tofu. Garnish with the crushed peanuts and toasted sesame seeds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5eba502ebcb2e97b7b7589e7/step-68b02c5f.jpg"
    }
  ]
